<title>POLAND: Mostostal E sees 97 group net rising.</title>
<headline>Mostostal E sees 97 group net rising.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction and trading firm Mostostal Export SA expects to lift its group net profit to between 51 and 53 million zlotys this year from 43.1 million zlotys in 1996, the company said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Mostostal said group sales would rise to between 650 and 670 million zlotys from 494.9 million in 1996.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
